  aciklama:
  - "2007 \xF6yle mi?\r\nLuciano Pavarotti o y\u0131l pankreas kanseri dolay\u0131s\u0131yla
    vefat etmi\u015Fti. B\xFCy\xFCk adamd\u0131..."
  - "Aaa 2007 mi?\r\nO y\u0131l, Mevlana'n\u0131n do\u011Fumunun 800'\xFCnc\xFC y\u0131l\u0131
    olmas\u0131 nedeniyle UNESCO taraf\u0131ndan D\xFCnya Mevlana Y\u0131l\u0131
    olarak belirlenmi\u015Fti. G\xFCzel y\u0131la denk gelmi\u015Fsin bak... "
  - "2007 \xF6yle mi?\r\nO y\u0131l Windows'un Vista adl\u0131 s\xFCr\xFCm\xFC sat\u0131\u015Fa
    sunulmu\u015Ftu. Kur kur \xF6ld\xFCk..."
  - "Demek 2007 y\u0131l\u0131...\r\nHi\xE7 unutmam, Harry Potter serisinin beklenen
    filmi Harry Potter ve Z\xFCmr\xFCd\xFCanka Yolda\u015Fl\u0131\u011F\u0131, T\xFCrkiye'de
    g\xF6sterime girdi ve ilk g\xFCnde 80.000 ki\u015Fi izledi. Sen ka\xE7\u0131rd\u0131n
    tabii..."
  - "2007 y\u0131l\u0131 ha?\r\nO y\u0131l efsanelerin y\u0131l\u0131yd\u0131. Apple'\u0131n
    ak\u0131ll\u0131 telefon serisi iPhone'un ilk nesli o y\u0131l \xE7\u0131km\u0131\u015Ft\u0131. "
